<title>POLAND: WEDEL SETS ISSUE PRICE FOR PEPSICO .</title>
<headline>WEDEL SETS ISSUE PRICE FOR PEPSICO .</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish confectionery Wedel SA set price for its new 145,713 share issue for PepsiCo Finance Limited at 95.36 zlotys per share, Wedel said in an issue prospectus.</p>
<p>PepsiCo currently has about 3.9 million of Wedel's 5.8 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
